  "top10": {
    "introHtml": "<p>Ranked for a cheap, fun 4-seat second car with <em>condition over miles</em>. German convertibles dominate the local market in this price range: Audi A5 and BMW 3/4-series offer the best blend of 4-seat room, reliability, and driving pleasure. The 2001 Mercedes CLK at 34,866 miles ($13,240 from Selden Motors) was considered but its 25-year age raises seals/rubber concerns despite the remarkable odometer. 2 SLK roadsters excluded from CarGurus results (2-seat). Sourcing: 5 picks from AutoTrader, 4 from CarGurus, 1 from Cars.com.</p>",
