        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "whyGood": "The Audi A5 Cabriolet is the gold standard for 4-seat drop-tops \u2014 a genuinely gorgeous car with a substantial back seat, solid build quality, and a smooth 2.0T engine. Only 55,608 miles at this price is exceptional; you'll struggle to find an A5 under 80k in this budget.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full convertible top cycle (especially seal integrity around rear window seam). Drain hose blockage causes interior flooding \u2014 inspect carpet for water stains. Haldex AWD service history. Timing chain tensioner (2.0T EA888). Rocker panels for rust. Check transmission fluid color (S tronic).",
        "bottomLine": "Best all-round 4-seat convertible in the market right now \u2014 low miles, beautiful styling, and Audi build quality at a fair price."
