        "whatToVerify": "Full convertible top cycle (F1 hydraulic \u2014 expensive if pump fails). Engine oil leaks (valve cover, oil pan), cooling system condition (E6x are notorious for head bolts). Rear seat access and headliner water stains. Icom scan for fault codes.",
