    "introHtml": "<p>Manual-transmission 4-seat convertibles in a 35-mile radius of Media PA, $7k\u2013$15k, are exceptionally scarce. Only <strong>1 confirmed manual</strong> surfaced across all three sources this refresh: the 2011 BMW 328i private listing on Cars.com. The 2002 Audi TT Roadster (manual) was excluded per the 2-seat deny list. Many listings have null transmission \u2014 if a manual is a priority, call the dealer directly before visiting.</p>",
