        "whatToVerify": "Clutch engagement point \u2014 a high bite point means worn clutch. Synchro feel in 2nd and 3rd (cold and warm). Throw-out bearing for chirp at idle with clutch pressed. Hydraulic clutch line for weeping. Top full cycle and rear window seam. Oil leaks (valve cover, oil pan). Cooling system condition.",
